      "public_source_file": "Lean/Reference/ComplexityReduction/Presentation/Partition.lean",
      "rationale": "The canonical target stores weights with unaryNat.  The available certified representation adapter runs from unary Partition to binary Partition; v1 requested the reverse direction from the binary hardness route.  A literal binary-to-unary expansion can be exponential in encoded input length and therefore is not an admissible polynomial bridge without new independent evidence.  This classification makes no tractability claim.",
